      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The smaller a user base for a feature, the less likely VRChat is to implement. \n\nhttps://github.com/bluenviron/mediamtx\n\nOn a local network mediamtx has very low latency when serving to rtsp client.\n\nIf you're wanting to use NDI to route video data like through however worlds process video, you're actually wanting AVPro to support NDI..\n\nTry the local streaming.",
